  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4f57265f2d95884493f924517248368, type: 3}
  m_Name: OldMan 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeText
  paragraphs:
  - 'Hmm? How did I know you hat a hat without me eyes? Its a good question... '
  - When I was a younger man, younger than you now, there was this temple on the
    hill outside my house.
  - Big, large lookin' building. Think it was an industrial complex bought out by
    some traditionalists.
  - Anyways they trained students there. Exclusive sect of young men and woman who'd
    over time they'd turn into warriors.
  - 'Don''t know what happened to them, they''d always leave all proper and you''d
    never hear about them again. '
  - I guess the brightest stars burn the fastest...
